#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/missed-day-sheet.tsx
msgctxt "iFHGDa"
msgid "The spreadsheet doesn't change by itself. Now you redo the whole week by hand."
msgstr "Arkusz sam się nie zmieni. Teraz musisz ręcznie rozpisać cały tydzień od nowa."

#. A learner's own worry, in their casual words, shown as a big quote. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Será que já sei o suficiente?”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/ready-section.tsx
msgctxt "hlr-77"
msgid "Do I know enough yet?"
msgstr "Czy wiem już wystarczająco dużo?"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/ready-section.tsx
msgctxt "hRjp9H"
msgid "<b>Take mock exams in the real exam's format and time.</b> At the end, you see an estimate of your score and what's still missing."
msgstr "<b>Rozwiązuj egzaminy próbne w formacie właściwego egzaminu i z takim samym limitem czasu.</b> Na koniec zobaczysz szacowany wynik i to, co trzeba jeszcze nadrobić."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/ready-section.tsx
msgctxt "cpAOYg"
msgid "Mock exam {number, number} · {name}"
msgstr "Egzamin próbny {number, number} · {name}"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/ready-section.tsx
msgctxt "fi0FtL"
msgid "Available with Plus"
msgstr "Dostępne w pakiecie Plus"

#. Exams report a score, a grade or a band (13–15/20, 2–3등급): use the word that fits your country's exam.
