msgstr "Pominięte lekcje: <b>{count, number}</b>"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "ZGEwEX"
msgid "Answer the question and watch your plan change."
msgstr "Odpowiedz na pytanie i zobacz, jak zmienia się twój plan."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "VXuhxV"
msgid "<b>You already know this.</b> Your plan skipped {count, plural, one {# lesson} other {# lessons}} on percentages."
msgstr "<b>To już umiesz.</b> W twoim planie pominięto {count, plural, one {# lekcję} few {# lekcje} other {# lekcji}} o procentach."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "C1Q1g9"
msgid "<b>Noted.</b> Percentages stay in your plan."
msgstr "<b>Jasne.</b> Procenty zostają w twoim planie."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "3tHxl3"
msgid "<b>That's fine.</b> Your plan teaches percentages from the basics."
msgstr "<b>W porządku.</b> Twój plan obejmuje naukę procentów od podstaw."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "3PZM1V"
msgid "Ratio and proportion"
msgstr "Stosunki i proporcje"

#. A math topic. In Brazilian Portuguese “Regra de três”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "WBm69y"
msgid "Cross-multiplication"
msgstr "Mnożenie na krzyż"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "mg-aO7"
msgid "Compound interest"
msgstr "Procent składany"

#. A math topic. In Brazilian Portuguese “Funções do 1º grau”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "FYV21J"
msgid "Linear functions"
msgstr "Funkcje liniowe"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "LkDjkt"
msgid "Question {number, number} · {subject}"
msgstr "Pytanie {number, number} · {subject}"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
#: src/lib/categories/category.ts
msgctxt "dPgwrL"
msgid "Math"
msgstr "Matematyka"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "2F9-v0"
msgid "A price goes up 20%, then down 20%. What percent of the original price is it now?"
msgstr "Cena rośnie o 20%, a potem spada o 20%. Jaki procent pierwotnej ceny stanowi teraz?"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "akd-cv"
msgid "Answer options"
msgstr "Odpowiedzi do wyboru"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "h5CuXu"
msgid "I don't know yet"
msgstr "Jeszcze nie wiem"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "yFLiQM"
msgid "It's not scored."
msgstr "To pytanie nie jest punktowane."

#. A learner's own worry, in their casual words, shown as a big quote. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Não sei por onde começar.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "JAnSgb"
msgid "I don't know where to start."
msgstr "Nie wiem, od czego zacząć."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/start-section.tsx
msgctxt "PZYp7C"
msgid "<b>Start with a few quick questions.</b> In about 2 minutes, Zoonk sees what you already know, and your plan skips that part."
msgstr "<b>Zacznij od kilku krótkich pytań.</b> W około 2 minuty Zoonk sprawdzi, co już umiesz, a twój plan pominie tę część."

#. A school subject area. In Brazilian Portuguese “Ciências da Natureza”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "H0lYkC"
msgid "Natural sciences"
msgstr "Nauki przyrodnicze"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "72N7d0"
msgid "In a pasture, grass is eaten by grasshoppers, grasshoppers by frogs and frogs by snakes."
msgstr "Na pastwisku koniki polne zjadają trawę, żaby zjadają koniki polne, a węże zjadają żaby."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "weP8DM"
msgid "The energy available shrinks at each level of this chain. What's the main reason?"
msgstr "Na każdym kolejnym poziomie tego łańcucha jest mniej dostępnej energii. Jaka jest główna przyczyna?"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "1nJY2_"
msgid "Your answer"
msgstr "Twoja odpowiedź"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "XSkW9E"
msgid "Predators eat less than their prey"
msgstr "Drapieżniki jedzą mniej niż ich ofiary"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "6NoIUl"
msgid "Correct"
msgstr "Poprawna"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "PALJLs"
msgid "Part of the energy turns into heat as each living thing breathes"
msgstr "Część energii zamienia się w ciepło podczas oddychania organizmów"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "bJBtpz"
msgid "Plants photosynthesize less at night"
msgstr "W nocy fotosynteza u roślin zachodzi mniej intensywnie"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "_XE_0X"
msgid "Saved to your mistakes notebook"
msgstr "Zapisano w zeszycie błędów"

#. The study buddy's casual joke: you don't gain the weight of the plate of food you ate.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "43yP-p"
msgid "You eat lunch and don't gain the weight of the plate, right? Almost all of it becomes energy for your day. It's the same with the frog: only a small part of the grasshopper becomes frog."
msgstr "Jesz obiad, ale nie przybywa ci na wadze tyle, ile ważyła cała porcja, prawda? Prawie cały posiłek zamienia się w energię na resztę dnia. Z żabą jest tak samo: tylko niewielka część konika polnego staje się częścią jej ciała."

#. A learner's casual message to their study buddy. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Me dá um exemplo”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "Bv5nVy"
msgid "Give me an example"
msgstr "Podaj mi przykład"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/stuck-section.tsx
msgctxt "77DoST"
msgid "Each animal uses almost all the energy it eats just to stay alive. Very little is left to become body. That little bit is what passes on to whoever eats it."
